window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>One thing I did not expect when spending the night with the devil, was waking up the next day with wings on my back.</p> <p>But then, I also didn’t expect to be caught up in a second murder - this time of somebody I actually know, or to be attacked by creatures from hell, and to find out my parents were keeping an epic secret from me. All this might be tolerable, if I only could fall into Nox’s arms and let him take me to that place that only he can. </p> <p>But until we lift his curse, I’m not even allowed to kiss him. And man, do I want more than a kiss. He’s changing me, making me something stronger, something better. But if we give in, I’ll do the opposite to him. I could kill him. </p> <p><i>Fallen Feathers</i> the second book in The Devil’s Deal series, and is a steamy fantasy romance with an HEA and fully consensual adult situations. If you like outrageously hot men with Irish accents and big wings, you’re going to love Nox.</p>"; 
